OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,6,     F1/5. Donald Macleod journeys
OL,7,     Fthrough the early years of Alice
OL,8,     FMary Smith, with guests Ian
OL,9,     FGraham-Jones and Leanne Langley.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FKatie Derham talks to conductor
OL,12,     FOmer Meir Wellber ahead of his BBC
OL,13,     FProm, and Oxford Piano Festival
OL,14,     Fartist Rustem Hayroudinoff
OL,15,     Fperforms live in the studio.
OL,16,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,17,     FLive at the BBC Proms: the London
OL,18,     FPhilharmonic Orchestra & conductor
OL,19,     FEdward Gardner are joined by
OL,20,     Fsoprano Louise Alder in a
OL,21,     Fprogramme of TjC8gersen,
OL,22,     FCanteloube & Richard Strauss.
